### Replace URL, ingestion key, integration ID and timestamps before sending.
### Timestamps must be in the preceding seven days, never in the future.
POST https://YOUR-BACKEND.vercel.app/api/ingest
Authorization: Bearer <ingestion-api-key>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "events": [
